+These focused host tests execute the production routing, cached-card proof and framework profile projection against the real frozen Android 37 framework classes. They are intentionally outside Gradle local unit tests, whose android.jar methods are stubs. The corresponding source compilation and explicit JUnit runner command are recorded in the reviewed host artifact esim-native-profile-publication1/FOCUSED-FINAL.json.
+
+They do not invoke a real SubscriptionManager, radio, APDU, profile operation, or Android UI. Native Settings row publication and accessibility still require a rebuilt candidate and a device test.
